# Brick plate 0: a 1 x 1 round plate of lilac toy-brick plastic (toy_plastic_lilac), 0.48 m across and 0.2 m tall (60 times life size): a flat
# round disc with one round stud on top. Ground clutter: no collider, lying on the floor.
format 1

# An eighth of the vertices its size would give it: a small plain disc
Detail detail=0.2
    Material material=toy_plastic_lilac
        Union
            Translate translation=(0, 0.06, 0)
                RoundedCylinder radius=0.24 roundness=0.02 height=0.06
            Translate translation=(0, 0.16, 0)
                RoundedCylinder radius=0.145 roundness=0.02 height=0.04
